# .dockerignore — repo root (Docker build context for apps/cms/Dockerfile)
# Keeps Docker build context lean by excluding non-essential files.

# Dependencies (reinstalled in the build)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo

# Git / IDE / tooling
.git
.github
.husky
.sonar
.code-review-graph
.kiro
.turbo

# Docs (not needed for CMS build)
docs

# Build artifacts & caches
**/.cache
**/dist
**/.vercel
**/.open-next

# Env files (secrets — never bake into image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Other apps (not part of this build — but we still need their package.json
# for workspace resolution, so we don't exclude apps/ entirely)
apps/web/.next
apps/admin/.next
apps/web/.open-next
apps/admin/.open-next

# Tests & dev files
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/e2e
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/__tests__

# Misc
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/.DS_Store
